{"version":1,"key":"doc:project:47:723","content":{"id":723,"title":"用最少数量的箭引爆气球","content":[{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"3f9af776-69da-46bc-93ed-1cf7949937a1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"题目描述"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"6181964a-c6be-418a-af7e-1a7caf2346da","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"有一些球形气球贴在一堵用 XY 平面表示的墙面上。墙面上的气球记录在整数数组 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"points"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，其中 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"points[i] = [x_start, x_end]"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 表示水平直径在 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"x_start"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"x_end"},{"type":"formatted","text":"之间的气球。你不知道气球的确切 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"y"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 坐标。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"5f483bc2-f455-45fc-9c08-7bb265ea2763","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"一支弓箭可以沿着 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"x"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 轴从不同点 完全垂直 地射出。在坐标 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"x"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 处射出一支箭，若有一个气球的直径的开始和结束坐标为 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"x_start"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"x_end"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，且满足 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"x_start ≤ x ≤ x_end"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，则该气球会被引爆。可以射出的弓箭的数量没有限制。弓箭一旦被射出之后，可以无限地前进。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"45a9f421-1b21-4458-999d-3d3a94e51a3e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"给你一个数组 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"points"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，返回引爆所有气球所必须射出的最小弓箭数。"}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"9c65483f-f433-4ce4-bf45-36f7d4fab891","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"解题思路"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"9baf9816-0409-4e94-a95d-c0d9798b37cf","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"以气球最右端进行从小到大排序，排序后，对于一个区间，后续的区间如果与该区间有交集，即这些区间的起始位置小于该区间的结束位置，那么这些区间就可以一箭解决，否则就需要新开一箭。"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"ts","uuid":"f4a3b9bd-cc3a-4934-a89e-596c22341578","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"05ca3ea5-468d-409b-aa4b-b7adac3230b4","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"function findMinArrowShots(points: number[][]): number {\n    points.sort((a, b) => a[1] - b[1]);\n    let preEnd = points[0][1];\n    let res = 1;\n    for (let i = 1; i < points.length; i++) {\n        if (points[i][0] > preEnd) {\n            preEnd = points[i][1];\n            res++;\n        }\n    }\n\n    return res;\n};","collabId":"1277efc2-369f-4579-adf6-875dec155b98","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"56b447f1-17d0-4bcb-af4a-5bd0e1eba3a7","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"参考"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"d0f6d421-86b9-481e-a02f-498f4ab52968","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"10690bf2-db8f-4767-8111-00766a8f49b0","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"533c990a-bf93-4f56-9b10-36bbe27b9017","children":[{"type":"link","url":"https://leetcode.cn/problems/minimum-number-of-arrows-to-burst-balloons/?envType=study-plan-v2&envId=top-interview-150","openEdit":false,"tauContract":"ebf1d56e356279ad64279a16e90d9b28280f70eac20d5071950fc0c4b5c364a6","collabId":"41f24404-c7d5-413a-8c4a-27c158d5cc98","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"用最少数量的箭引爆气球"}]}]}]}]}],"breadcrumb":[{"label":"LeetCode","target":{"key":"doc:project:47:718","type":"doc","id":718}},{"label":"贪心"},{"label":"用最少数量的箭引爆气球","target":{"key":"doc:project:47:723","type":"doc","id":723}}],"prevPage":{"title":"加油站","target":{"key":"doc:project:47:721","type":"doc","id":721}},"nextPage":{"title":"x 的平方根","target":{"key":"doc:project:47:715","type":"doc","id":715}},"createTime":1730039141313,"updateTime":1744296863904,"projectId":47},"meta":{"type":"doc","publishTime":1744296863904}}